Hakem — a kernel-checked writing system for machine reasoning
Copyright 2026 kimahmet (https://github.com/kimahmet)

This product originates from the vision and direction of kimahmet:
an independent, small, auditable referee — a "writing system" for AI —
through which models record, communicate and verify interdisciplinary
results, and through which the oversight of autonomous AI learning can be
automated.

The implementation was developed with the assistance of Claude (Anthropic),
working under kimahmet's direction.

